<div id="pf19" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="19"><div class="pc pc19 w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 y292 w3 h32" alt="" src="bg19.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">6<span class="_ _7e"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _16"> </span>传输层<span class="_ _84"> </span><span class="ff3">6.3<span class="_ _12"> </span></span>三次握手<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Connection Es<span class="_ _3"></span>tablishment)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y7e ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">6.3<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">三次握手<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>(Connection<span class="_ _5"> </span>Establishment)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1a4 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.3.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">流程图解</span></div><div class="t m0 xf h6 y293 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">客户端<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Client)</span></div><div class="t m0 x8e h6 y294 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">服务器<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Serv<span class="_ _3"></span>er)</span></div><div class="t m0 x79 h8 y295 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Time<span class="_ _85"> </span>Time</div><div class="t m0 x77 h2d y296 ff6 fs1 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">SYN=1<span class="ff3">,<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>seq=x</div><div class="t m0 x27 h8 y297 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">CLOSED</div><div class="t m0 x8f h2d y298 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">SYN-SENT</div><div class="t m0 x68 h8 y299 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">LISTEN</div><div class="t m0 x68 h2d y29a ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">SYN-R<span class="_ _3"></span>CVD</div><div class="t m0 x4 h2d y29b ff6 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0">SYN=1<span class="ff3">,<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>A<span class="_ _4"></span>CK=1</div><div class="t m0 x57 h2d y29c ff6 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0">seq=y<span class="ff3">,<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>ack=x+1</div><div class="t m0 x90 h2d y29d ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">EST<span class="_ _29"></span>ABLISHED</div><div class="t m0 x91 h2d y29e ff6 fs1 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">A<span class="_ _4"></span>CK=1</div><div class="t m0 x92 h2d y29f ff6 fs1 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">seq=x+1<span class="ff3">,<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>ack=y+1</div><div class="t m0 x68 h2d y2a0 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">EST<span class="_ _29"></span>ABLISHED</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y2a1 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">6.3.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">详细步骤解析</span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y2a2 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">客户端发送<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(SYN)<span class="ff4">：客户端发送请求报文，<span class="ff10">SYN=1</span>，初始化序号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">seq=x</span>。此时客户端进入<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">SYN-SENT<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>状态。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y2a3 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">服务器回复<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(SYN+A<span class="_ _4"></span>CK)<span class="ff4">：服务器收到请求，发送确认报文。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2a4 ff10 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">SYN=1<span class="ff3">,<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>ACK=1<span class="ff4">。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2a5 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">确认号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">ack=x+1</span>（表示期待收到<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">x+1</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2a6 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">初始化自己的序号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">seq=y</span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2a7 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">服务器进入<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">SYN-RCVD<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>状态。</div><div class="t m0 x1d h6 y2a8 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">客户端确认<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(A<span class="_ _4"></span>CK)<span class="ff4">：客户端收到回复后，再次发送确认。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2a9 ff10 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">ACK=1<span class="ff4">。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2aa ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">确认号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">ack=y+1</span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2ab ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">自己的序号<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">seq=x+1</span>。</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y2ac ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">双方进入<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">ESTABLISHED</span>（连接建立）状态。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y2ad ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">6.4<span class="_ _24"> </span><span class="ff1">数据传输<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>(Data<span class="_ _5"> </span>T<span class="_ _4"></span>ransmission)</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y2ae ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">连接建立后，双方进行双向数据传输。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y2af ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">每一方发送数据时，<span class="ff10">seq<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>随数据长度增加。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y2b0 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">接收方回复<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff10">ACK<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>时，<span class="ff10">ack<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>号累积确认。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y2b1 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">比如客户端发送了<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">L<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>字节数据，当前<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">seq<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑁<span class="_ _11"></span></span>，回复<span class="_ _7e"> </span><span class="ff3">ack<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑁<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>𝐿<span class="_ _f"></span></span>，则下一次<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">seq </span>为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑁<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>𝐿<span class="_ _f"></span></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">20<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
